+# Performance history
+
+## UserPromptSubmit read path
+
+The repository does not contain a measured full-recall p95 for the adversarial
+synthetic corpus whose frequent vocabulary is the 30 words in
+`crates/muninn-bench/src/main.rs`, either before or after the term-selection
+fix. Consequently, no before/after number is reported here.
+
+The fix is in `select_terms` in `crates/muninn-core/src/recall.rs`: after looking
+up document frequency, it drops a term when the store has at least 50 active
+records and the term occurs in more than one third of them. This prevents the
+30 common synthetic terms from producing long FTS5 posting-list scans; the
+remaining candidates are ordered by IDF and limited to eight terms.
+
+The project's other measurements are not substitutes for the missing
+adversarial full-hook figures. In particular, `[H6]` in
+`research/00-evidence-log.md` measures only the BM25 stage on a different
+50,000-record corpus (p95 35.53 ms for the first 24 terms and 8.75 ms for the
+eight highest-IDF terms), while `[I3]` measures the complete hook on that corpus
+at p95 4.31 ms.
